STARTFONT 2.1
COMMENT gpsp10: UI font for gpSP kai. Public domain.
COMMENT Glyph shapes from the X11 misc-fixed 6x10 font (Markus Kuhn et al.,
COMMENT "Public domain font. Share and enjoy."), placed in 10x10 cells with
COMMENT proportional advance widths (glyph width + 1 pixel).
COMMENT Exceptions: . , : ; are from misc-fixed 6x9; the digits 0 1 6 9 were
COMMENT drawn for gpSP kai in the classic 5x7 dot-matrix style (public domain).
FONT -gpSP-gpsp10-Medium-R-Normal--10-100-75-75-P-50-ISO10646-1
SIZE 10 75 75
FONTBOUNDINGBOX 10 10 0 -2
STARTPROPERTIES 4
FONT_ASCENT 8
FONT_DESCENT 2
DEFAULT_CHAR 32
COPYRIGHT "Public domain. Glyphs from X11 misc-fixed 6x10."
ENDPROPERTIES
